# 💬 AI Review Sentiment Analyzer

An end-to-end Machine Learning application that analyzes English customer reviews and predicts whether the expressed sentiment is **Positive 😊** or **Negative 😡**.

The project demonstrates the complete Machine Learning workflow, from dataset preparation and text preprocessing to model training, evaluation, application development, GitHub version control, and cloud deployment using Streamlit.

## 🚀 Live Application

🔗 **Streamlit App:** [PASTE YOUR STREAMLIT APP LINK HERE]

## 📂 Project Overview

The **AI Review Sentiment Analyzer** is a binary text classification application built using Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Machine Learning.

A user enters an English review into the application, and the trained model analyzes the text and predicts its sentiment.

### The application workflow

```text
User Review
     ↓
Text Input
     ↓
TF-IDF Feature Extraction
     ↓
Logistic Regression Model
     ↓
Sentiment Prediction
     ↓
😊 Positive  /  😡 Negative
